79,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85PVVT7","user":{"login":"bsdimp","id":4139006,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzkwMDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4139006?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp","html_url":"https://github.com/bsdimp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-11-29T17:10:00Z","updated_at":"2022-11-29T17:10:00Z","body":"+1 to allow. Could almost be variation in MIT license...\r\nNot sure why it needs \"In addition, the following condition applies: All redistributions must retain an intact copy of this copyright notice and disclaimer.\" at the end, but maybe that's enough of a condition difference to not try to make it a MIT variant via markup.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1330992379/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1332345724","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1652#issuecomment-1332345724","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1652","id":1332345724,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85Paft8","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-11-30T15:27:22Z","updated_at":"2022-11-30T15:27:22Z","body":"agree @bsdimp - the addition of that last sentence is a bit superfluous. But there are some differences in the warranty section that are more worthy of being its own license","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1332345724/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1336264270","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1652#issuecomment-1336264270","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1652","id":1336264270,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85PpcZO","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-12-03T21:49:00Z","updated_at":"2022-12-03T21:49:00Z","body":"The first two paragraphs (permission grant and condition) are from [MIT](https://spdx.org/licenses/MIT.html), while the disclaimer of warranties is from [libtiff](https://spdx.org/licenses/libtiff.html).\r\n\r\nThe additional condition at the end doesn't appear to be a match to anything currently on the license list (though as noted above I doubt it has any practical distinction from the main obligation).\r\n\r\nGiven the above, I'm +1 to add as a separate license. Clearly a permissive-style license and appears in a significant number of projects and commercial products, so meets the license inclusion guidelines.\r\n\r\nThis makes 3 +1's and no objections since the issue was filed on Oct. 1, so I'm marking this as accepted (particularly in the light of this being marked high priority for Fedora).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1336264270/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1338791128","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/l